      "value": "I believe in the blogpost about the node graph system they said, that building a custom solution for game logic instead of playmaker would make it easyer to switch between unity versions. When they switch to unity 2018 the performance should be much better because of unitys multithreading capabilities",
      "viewerReactions": null
